SmartDeviceApplication: public keo_spine::
 * @startuml
 * () "ApplicationInterface" as appInterface
 * () "DeviceDistributorInterface" as DeviceDistributorInterface
 * () "DistributorDeviceInterface" as DistributorDeviceInterface
 * () "TransportConnectionInterface" as TransportConnectionInterface
 * () "DistributorConnectionInterface"
 * () "TransportConnectionHandlerInterface"
 * () "ShipControlInterface"
 * () "ShipNodeCreator"
 *
 * [distributor] as "Distributor"
 * [application] as "SmartDeviceApplication"
 * [shipconnectionhandler] as "ShipConnectionHandler"
 * [distributor] as "Distributor"
 * [smartdevice] as "SmartDevice"
 * [shipDriver] as "ShipDriver"
 * [ShipConnectionCreator]
 *
 * note top of [smartdevice]
 *   Acts as 'main device'
 * end note
 *
 * note top of [DistributorDeviceInterface]
 *  sendDatagram()
 * end note
 *
 * note left of [DeviceDistributorInterface]
 *  announceDevice(), addDevice(), 
 *  removeDevice(), receivedDatagram(), 
 *  removeFromDestinationList()
 * end note
 * 
 * note top of [shipconnectionhandler]
 *  ShipConnectionHandler is a container for Transport connections.
 * end note
 *
 * note top of [ShipConnectionCreator]
 *  ShipConnectionCreator is a factory to create ShipConnections.
 *  The created ShipConnections are initialized with
 *  the connectionHandler(TransportConnectionHandlerInterface)
 *  and the shipListener(ShipControlInterface).
 * end note
 *
 * note bottom of [ShipNodeCreator]
 *  The ShipDriver uses the ShipConnectionCreator
 *  to produce new ShipConnections.
 * end note
 *
 * note top of TransportConnectionHandlerInterface
 *  The ShipConnection adds itself to the ShipConnectionHandler
 *  if the connection was established
 *  The ShipConnection removes itself from the ShipConnectionHandler
 *  if the connection was closed
 *  to produce new ShipConnections.
 * end note
 *
 * note top of TransportConnectionInterface
 *  getId(), sendMessage(), closeConnection()
 * end note
 *
 * note bottom of DistributorConnectionInterface
 *  announceDevice(), removeDevice(), receivedDatagram()
 * end note
 *
 * [ShipConnection] ..> TransportConnectionHandlerInterface
 * [ShipConnection] ..> ShipControlInterface
 *
 * [ShipConnectionCreator] -- ShipNodeCreator
 *
 * [distributor] -up- DistributorDeviceInterface
 * [distributor] -- DistributorConnectionInterface
 * [distributor] ..>  DeviceDistributorInterface: use
 * [distributor] .up.>  TransportConnectionInterface: use
 *
 * [shipDriver] -- ShipControlInterface
 * [shipDriver] ..> ShipNodeCreator: use
 *
 * [shipconnectionhandler] -up- TransportConnectionHandlerInterface
 * [shipconnectionhandler] -up-  TransportConnectionInterface
 * [shipconnectionhandler] ..> DistributorConnectionInterface: use
 *
 * [smartdevice] -down-  DeviceDistributorInterface
 * [smartdevice] ..>  DistributorDeviceInterface: use
 *
 * [application] -- appInterface
 *
 * @enduml

